{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office Chug</strong> is a darkly comedic single-player narrative game about an ex-alcoholic trying to straighten out his life. After applying for what seems like a simple job at a family-owned business, he discovers that the family is anything but ordinary. What begins as dull, repetitive office work soon spirals into surreal, dangerous demands from a deranged boss and his twisted household.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you pass time by quietly sipping drinks at your desk, careful not to be noticed \u2014 because in this office, being caught slacking means more than losing your job,. But as the levels progress, the boss\u2019s requests grow increasingly bizarre and sinister, pulling you into a nightmare of obedience, absurdity, and survival.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Orientation Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/0dc33b42512bdbc11b6abbdb910b5e8b8b4a88b0.jpg"},{"name":"Overtime Madness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/0b98dbdd4936d3dddbb77d38bd9ae5c00a6997ea.jpg"},{"name":"New Supplier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/1ba2e6b51ded8c8dd16f8eabbed922e23867f54a.jpg"},{"name":"Moving Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/d4ab3eb6c59b2ddf271783d2aa295b8dc6a0cb33.jpg"},{"name":"File Retrieval","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/1ccad6b5da8f3733df02df549b98b83b32b238f1.jpg"},{"name":"Lights Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/ec8d91c7432e301bd1782d6adbc17f4bf5bcd288.jpg"},{"name":"Safe Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001950/77ed894e74a1633a0f9793eb52b03cedd94f1861.jpg"},{"name":"Birthday Party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.ste